            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">• The bearer gains the following ability &apos;Fear (Aura): While an enemy unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, subtract 1 from the Leadership characteristic of models in that unit.&apos;
