          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, the bearer can recite the Feast of Malediction litany instead of reciting a litany that it knows. If it does, do not roll to see oif the litany is inspiring, it is automatically inspiring.</characteristic>
